! Definition of all Rosetta labels and strings - English version

! Rosetta labels: each widget can have one or more label strings
! This label has the following lay-out:
!
!     N_<prefix>_<name>_<type> :  '<label name>'
!
! The prefix, name and type are derived from the Xid-definition, except when the
! label does not correspond to an Xid; then an own name and/or type are chosen.

value

